# In a 2-minute run, the kickflip down Big 3 flies through the S and hits the BIG 3 GAP.
park soma
spawn big3
cmd 0 run start
hold up 0..100
hold ollie 166..196
tap flip+left 202
run 420
expect event runStart within 1..2
expect event letter{letter=S,have=S____} within 215..300
expect event gap{gap=BIG 3 GAP} within 320..340
expect session.letters == S at end
